n – Strengthen strands and enhance texture"}],["$","p","9",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Vitamin E – Protects and supports overall hair health"}],["$","h3","10",{"children":"Why You’ll Love It:"}],["$","p","11",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Tons of texture with a dry, matte finish"}],["$","p","12",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Medium hold that’s flexible and reworkable"}],["$","p","13",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Natural ingredients, no silicones or synthetic waxes"}],["$","p","14",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Works best on short to medium-length hair"}],["$","p","15",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Washes out easily with water"}],["$","p","16",{"children":["Style it messy, shape it clean, or build natural volume—this paste does it all, without the shine."]}]]}]]}]
